	(text "I =|(Vout - V0)|/sens\nP = [|(Vout - V0)|/sens]^2*R\nVout = sens*RAD( (P/R) )+V0\nP >= 500W  V0 = 2,5V sens = 60 mv/A R = 3,5 ohm \nFor Vout>=3,27V  P>=500W"
